    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursebound is a roguelite 'reverse tower defense' adventure where you assemble a powerful party, collect mystical creatures, and shape the battlefield to survive endless cursed cycles. It blends strategic party-building with deep synergies, letting you create unstoppable team compositions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit heroes, harness powerful curses, and manipulate the ever-changing world as you battle waves of evolving threats. Will you break the cycle or be consumed by it?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursebound is a roguelite 'reverse tower defense' adventure where you assemble a powerful party, collect mystical creatures, and shape the battlefield to survive endless cursed cycles. It blends strategic party-building with deep synergies, letting you create unstoppable team compositions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit heroes, harness powerful curses, and manipulate the ever-changing world as you battle waves of evolving threats. Will you break the cycle or be consumed by it?</p>",
    "short_description": "Cursebound is a roguelite \u2018reverse tower defense\u2019 game where you recruit and evolve a party of powerful creatures. Shape the battlefield, harness unique synergies, and master deep RPG mechanics to survive endless cursed cycles. Strategize, adapt, and break the curse!",
